628\" width=512 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882280/extras/cd04c3469fd97447e0f8214aea28466e.webm?t=1732035628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882280/extras/cd04c3469fd97447e0f8214aea28466e.mp4?t=1732035628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SUPER BONES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect SUPER BONES through combos or discover them in small locked-away temples! Then deposit them at the TEMPLE to upgrade DOG\u2019s Maximum Health to help you on your journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882280/extras/e123ab9dce4dc160802689d09df9e427.poster.avif?t=1732035628\" width=512 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882280/extras/e123ab9dce4dc160802689d09df9e427.webm?t=1732035628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882280/extras/e123ab9dce4dc160802689d09df9e427.mp4?t=1732035628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HATS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and equip DOG with ABILITY or STYLE hats! ABILITY hats that will give DOG unique abilities such as the STONE CHOMP, \u00bd DAMAGE or the TRIPLE JUMP. STYLE hats will double the score points to help you achieve that elusive HIGH SCORE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882280/extras/7106375bf32cd8195fe6647b3c7c4cae.poster.avif?t=1732035628\" width=512 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882280/extras/7106375bf32cd8195fe6647b3c7c4cae.webm?t=1732035628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882280/extras/7106375bf32cd8195fe6647b3c7c4cae.mp4?t=1732035628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>99 Mode!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finishing the story unlocks 99 Mode! Play through 99 levels of randomized elements from all biomes and permanently unlock Ability Hats in your Hat Closet!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882280/extras/420637042e1dd36b08427ef6fde152ab.poster.avif?t=1732035628\" width=512 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882280/extras/420637042e1dd36b08427ef6fde152ab.webm?t=1732035628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882280/extras/420637042e1dd36b08427ef6fde152ab.mp4?t=1732035628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
